{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfc; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b7280; --accent:#6f56ff; --accent-600:#5a3ef0; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(20,20,40,0.08);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f7f8fb);color:#111827;line-height:1.45}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px;background:var(--card);box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-600));color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent);background:rgba(111,86,255,0.06)}
    .primary-cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:20px;align-items:start}

    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px 0}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-weight:600;color:#111827}
    input[type='text'],input[type='email'],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:120px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .small{flex:1}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}

    /* Progress meter / 30-day path */
    .progress-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .goals{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    .goal{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbff);border:1px solid #eef2ff}
    .pathmap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .habit{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .habit .label{width:150px;font-weight:600}
    .days{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(30,1fr);gap:3px;flex:1}
    .day{height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:#f1f5f9}
    .day.on{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-600))}
    .summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbff)}

    /* Proof Gallery */
    .gallery{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .testimonial{min-height:84px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#111827}
    .meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px}
    .badge{background:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eef2ff;position:relative}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,6px);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:#111827;color:#fff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .18s}

    footer{margin-top:20px;padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.brand h2{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class='brand'>
      <div class='logo'>W</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href='index.html'>Start</a>
      <a href='about.html'>Approach</a>
      <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
      <a href='programs.html'>Journeys</a>
      <a href='pricing.html'>Investment</a>
      <a href='testimonials.html'>Voices</a>
      <a href='book.html' class='primary-cta'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class='grid'>
      <section class='card'>
        <h1>Connect with a practical guide for daily change</h1>
        <p class='lead'>Share a little about your current daily pattern and what matters. We respond with a clear first 30-day path and options to continue with guided support.</p>

        <form id='contactForm' class='card' onsubmit='submitContact(event)'>
          <div class='row'>
            <div class='small'>
              <label for='name'>Your name</label>
              <input id='name' name='name' type='text' placeholder='Ana Rivera' required>
            </div>
            <div class='small'>
              <label for='email'>Email</label>
              <input id='email' name='email' type='email' placeholder='you@domain.com' required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for='phone'>Phone</label>
            <input id='phone' name='phone' type='text' placeholder='{{PHONE}}'>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for='message'>Tell me briefly what you want to achieve</label>
            <textarea id='message' name='message' placeholder='Example: sleep better, consistent energy through afternoons, calmer mornings'></textarea>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for='how'>Best next step</label>
            <select id='how' name='how'>
              <option value='call'>Phone consult</option>
              <option value='email'>Email plan</option>
              <option value='book'>Book a session</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center'>
            <button class='btn' type='submit'>Send message</button>
            <div style='color:var(--muted);font-size:14px'>Or call <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class='card'>
          <h3 style='margin:0 0 6px 0'>Map your next 30 days</h3>
          <p class='lead' style='margin:0 0 12px 0'>Choose the small rhythms you want to build. We draw a simple 30-day path you can preview and tweak.</p>

          <div class='progress-wrap' id='progressWrap'>
            <div class='goals' id='goals'>
              <label class='goal'><input type='checkbox' value='sleep'/> Better sleep timing</label>
              <label class='goal'><input type='checkbox' value='movement'/> Daily movement</label>
              <label class='goal'><input type='checkbox' value='hydration'/> Hydration habit</label>
              <label class='goal'><input type='checkbox' value='mindful'/> Short daily pause</label>
              <label class='goal'><input type='checkbox' value='planning'/> Evening planning</label>
            </div>

            <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px'>
              <button class='btn' id='mapBtn' onclick='generatePath()' style='flex:1'>Map my 30 days</button>
              <button class='btn' id='clearBtn' onclick='clearPath()' style='background:#f3f4f6;color:#111827'>Clear</button>
            </div>

            <div class='pathmap' id='pathmap' aria-live='polite' style='margin-top:12px'></div>

            <div class='summary' id='pathSummary' style='display:none'>
              <div id='summaryText'></div>
              <div><a href='book.html' class='primary-cta'>Reserve a planning call</a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:14px'>
          <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Proof & Credibility</h4>
          <p class='lead' style='margin:0 0 12px 0'>Real notes from people who built a steadier groove — and small badges that explain method and validation.</p>

          <div class='gallery'>
            <div class='testimonial card' id='testimonial'>
              <div class='quote' id='quoteText'>"I started with two small shifts and woke up noticing a calmer decision-making rhythm."</div>
              <div class='meta' id='quoteMeta'>— L.M., small business owner</div>
            </div>

            <div class='badges' id='badgesArea'>
              <div class='badge' tabindex='0'>Habit Labs
                <div class='tooltip'>Short-cycle habit experiments used for 2-week checks</div>
              </div>
              <div class='badge' tabindex='0'>Framework Certified
                <div class='tooltip'>Program structures aligned to practical behavior frameworks</div>
              </div>
              <div class='badge' tabindex='0'>Local Workshops
                <div class='tooltip'>Community sessions run in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px'>
              <button class='btn' id='prevTest' onclick='prevTestimonial()' style='background:#eef2ff;color:var(--accent)'>Prev</button>
              <button class='btn' id='nextTest' onclick='nextTestimonial()' style='background:#eef2ff;color:var(--accent)'>Next</button>
              <div style='flex:1;text-align:right;color:var(--muted)'>Powered by clear outcomes, not quick fixes</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div class='card' style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px'>
        <div>
          <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style='color:var(--muted)'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
        <div style='color:var(--muted)'>Email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none'>{{EMAIL}}</a> · {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Contact stub — no real network
    function submitContact(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      var name = document.getElementById('name').value || 'Friend';
      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. We received your message and will be in touch at ' + (document.getElementById('email').value || '{{EMAIL}}') + '.');
      e.target.reset();
    }

    // Progress meter: simple 30-day path generator
    function daysArray(n){
      return Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>i+1);
    }

    function generatePath(){
      var checked = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#goals input:checked')).map(i=>i.value);
      var container = document.getElementById('pathmap');
      container.innerHTML = '';
      if(checked.length===0){
        container.innerHTML = '<div style="color:var(--muted)">Pick goals to draw a simple path.</div>';
        document.getElementById('pathSummary').style.display='none';
        return;
      }

      // deterministic pseudo-random based on selected labels
      var seed = checked.join('|').split('').reduce((s,c)=>s+ c.charCodeAt(0),0);
      function pr(){ seed = (seed * 9301 + 49297) % 233280; return seed/233280; }

      var days = daysArray(30);
      var overall = 0;

      checked.forEach(function(habit){
        var row = document.createElement('div'); row.className='habit';
        var label = document.createElement('div'); label.className='label'; label.textContent = ({
          sleep:'Sleep timing', movement:'Movement', hydration:'Hydration', mindful:'Daily pause', planning:'Evening planning'
        }[habit]||habit);

        var daysWrap = document.createElement('div'); daysWrap.className='days';

        // intensity: how many days likely to be 'on'
        var intensity = 0.5 + (pr()-0.4); // range roughly 0.1 - 0.9
        days.forEach(function(d){
          var el = document.createElement('div'); el.className='day';
          // create streaks by biasing on neighbors
          var chance = intensity + (Math.sin(d/3 + pr()*3)*0.08);
          if(pr() < chance) el.classList.add('on');
          daysWrap.appendChild(el);
        });
        // rough percent
        var percent = Math.round((daysWrap.querySelectorAll('.on').length / 30) * 100);
        overall += percent;

        var meta = document.createElement('div'); meta.style.fontSize='13px'; meta.style.color='var(--muted)'; meta.textContent = percent + '% predicted consistency';
        var col = document.createElement('div'); col.style.display='flex'; col.style.flexDirection='column'; col.style.gap='8px';
        col.appendChild(daysWrap); col.appendChild(meta);

        row.appendChild(label); row.appendChild(col);
        container.appendChild(row);
      });

      var avg = Math.round(overall / checked.length);
      var summary = document.getElementById('pathSummary');
      document.getElementById('summaryText').textContent = 'Estimated average consistency: ' + avg + '% over 30 days.';
      summary.style.display='flex';

      // Add short recommendations under map
      var rec = document.createElement('div'); rec.style.marginTop='10px'; rec.style.color='var(--muted)'; rec.style.fontSize='13px';
      rec.innerHTML = '<strong>Quick suggestions:</strong> start with 1–2 habits for the first 10 days, schedule reminders at the same anchor (morning or evening), and review every week.';
      container.appendChild(rec);
    }

    function clearPath(){
      document.getElementById('pathmap').innerHTML='';
      document.getElementById('pathSummary').style.display='none';
      Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#goals input')).forEach(i=>i.checked=false);
    }

    // Proof gallery: rotating testimonials and interactive badges
    (function(){
      var tests = [
        {text:'"I learned how a two-minute nightly plan made weekdays feel lighter."', meta:'— J.R., teacher'},
        {text:'"The small movement habit stacked into clearer energy windows by week three."', meta:'— P.S., designer'},
        {text:'"We reduced decision fatigue by setting a tiny morning ritual I could actually keep."', meta:'— C.K., parent'}
      ];
      var idx=0; var q = document.getElementById('quoteText'); var m = document.getElementById('quoteMeta');
      function show(i){ q.textContent = tests[i].text; m.textContent = tests[i].meta; }
      show(0);
      window.nextTestimonial = function(){ idx = (idx+1)%tests.length; show(idx); }
      window.prevTestimonial = function(){ idx = (idx-1+tests.length)%tests.length; show(idx); }
      setInterval(function(){ nextTestimonial(); },6000);
    })();

    // small accessibility: badges tooltips on keyboard focus
    Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.badge')).forEach(function(b){
      b.addEventListener('focus',function(){ b.querySelector('.tooltip').style.opacity=1; b.querySelector('.tooltip').style.transform='translateY(0)';});
      b.addEventListener('blur',function(){ b.querySelector('.tooltip').style.opacity=0; b.querySelector('.tooltip').style.transform='translateY(6px)';});
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact.html and README for wellness_coach project

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — a complete contact page with interactive features.
- README.md — this file.

How to use
1. Place contact.html alongside the other site pages (index.html, about.html, services.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html) in the site root.
2. The page references placeholders that must be replaced during templating or build-time:
   - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
   - {{TAGLINE}}
   - {{PHONE}}
   - {{EMAIL}}
   - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
   - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
   - {{CITY}}
   - {{STATE}}

Interactive features implemented locally (no external services):
- Progress meter / Path Map
  - Users select goals and click "Map my 30 days" to generate a 30-day visual path per habit.
  - The generator is deterministic per selection (simple seeded PRNG) so the preview is consistent while you experiment.
  - A summary area shows estimated average consistency and short suggestions with a CTA to book.

- Proof Gallery
  - Rotating testimonials switch automatically every 6 seconds and via Prev/Next controls.
  - Credibility badges include hover/focus tooltips describing what each badge means.

Design notes
- Layout follows a modern, clinical-aligned aesthetic with a warm, storyteller voice in copy.
- Navigation labels differ intentionally: Start, Approach, Offerings, Journeys, Investment, Voices, Book, Connect.
- No external fonts, images, or CDNs are used.
- The global SVG pattern asset (assets/img/pattern.svg) is expected elsewhere in the project — this chunk does not include it.

Accessibility
- Form controls are labeled.
- Tooltips are exposed on hover and keyboard focus.
- Dynamic updates use aria-live hints where appropriate.

Replacement / Integration
- Replace placeholders at build time or with your templating engine.
- The contact form is a local stub that alerts the user; hook it to your mail or lead-capture endpoint as needed.

Notes
- Keep outcome-focused language only; the page avoids medical claims and focuses on habits, outcomes, and frameworks.
- If you split assets across chunks, ensure assets/img/pattern.svg is unique and present per project guidelines.

Contact
- For integration questions, update the template placeholders or open a new task referencing the seed and layoutFamily.
"} 
